---
title: 'A swarming mind: the new hero'
date: 2026-11-17
summary: The home page now opens on a live point-cloud swarm that pulls together into a totem animal, then scatters when you click.
art: swarm-core
---

The home page has a new centre.

- **Swarm core.** It's a live three.js point cloud. It breathes, pulls together into the totem for your skin, then scatters. Your pointer steers it and a click breaks it apart.
- **БОГMODE ⇄ GODMODE.** The wordmark melts between the two every few seconds. Every mark on the page melts at the same time.
- **Everything at every scale.** ASCII animations show an atom, a microbe and a planet.
- **MONO skin.** Black, white, nothing else.

Motion pauses when it's off-screen. If you've asked for reduced motion, you get a still frame.
